<div class="govuk-summary-card govuk-!-margin-bottom-6" style="border-color: #c5a0d4; background-color: #f6f1f8;">
  <div class="govuk-summary-card__title-wrapper" style="flex-wrap: wrap; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 1em; background-color: #f6f1f8; border-top: 4px solid #732282; border-bottom: 1px solid #c5a0d4;">
    <h2 class="govuk-summary-card__title" style="margin-bottom: 0; color: #732282;">
      Potential new offence - identified by AI
    </h2>
    <span class="govuk-tag govuk-tag--yellow" style="font-size: 1rem; white-space: nowrap;">
      AI analysis
    </span>
  </div>
  <div class="govuk-summary-card__content">
    <p class="govuk-heading-s govuk-!-margin-bottom-2" style="color: #732282;">
      Handling stolen goods contrary to s.22 Theft Act 1968
    </p>
    <p class="govuk-!-margin-bottom-2">
      If the court is not satisfied beyond reasonable doubt that Quibble appropriated with dishonest intent to permanently deprive, they may still find the Quibble guilty of handling if they dishonestly received goods they knew or believed to be stolen.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="govuk-summary-card__title-wrapper" style="flex-wrap: wrap; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 1em; background-color: #f6f1f8; border-bottom: 1px solid #c5a0d4; border-top: 1px solid #b1b4b6;">
